sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server

    browser->>server: POST  https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note_spa
    activate server
    server-->>browser: status 201 Created
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: the server responds with a 201 Created status code, indicating that the new note was successfully created and shows the note in the SPA page.